{"seq":2,"slug":"auditing","title":"审计方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"static-analysis-tools","title":"静态分析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/static-analysis-tools","wordCount":838,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-testing-fuzzing","title":"动态测试与模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/dynamic-testing-fuzzing","wordCount":611,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"formal-verification","title":"形式化验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/formal-verification","wordCount":1197,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 审计方法论\n\n本章覆盖智能合约安全审计的三大技术支柱：静态分析（模式匹配与数据流追踪）、动态测试（模糊测试与不变式检验）、形式化验证（数学证明）。三者构成纵深防御的检测层，互补而非替代。\n\n静态分析速度最快、覆盖面最广但误报率较高；模糊测试能发现复杂状态路径下的隐蔽缺陷但依赖种子质量；形式化验证提供数学级确定性但编写规约成本最高。工程实践中三者通常串联使用。\n"}